'''Heavenly Herald Papuu''' (聖者ポプウ, ''Seija Popuu'', '''Saint Popuu''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Daboo of the Dead]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Papuu's Paradise]]. She was added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Heavenly Herald Papuu
|image = E 492.png
|appearance = [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Papuu's Paradise]]<br>[[Papuu's Paradox]]
|money drop = 4,444¢ - 17,553¢
}}

==Enemy==
Heavenly Herald Papuu is overall weaker than Daboo of the Dead, with less health and damage, but has a significantly longer [[Omni Strike]] range, increased speed, only 1 knockback, plus a shorter battlefield in her [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|debut stage]], allowing her to hit the [[Cat Base]] from afar and a faster attack rate. Her attack power is surprisingly low for a [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Boss]], at only 4,000, but her 40% [[Toxic]] ability allows her to destroy any non-[[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|immune]]/[[:Category:Resist Toxic Cats|resistant]] units in up to three hits. She retains all her predecessor's immunities with the addition of [[Wave Attack|Wave]] immunity, and her base damage is tripled at 30% HP, increasing to 12,000.

While having more than 30% health, Papuu eliminates cats with...
*0 ~ 6,666 health in one attack.
*6,667 ~ 40,000 health in two attacks.
*40,001~ health in three attacks.
While having less than 30% health, Papuu eliminates cats with...
*0 ~ 20,000 health in one attack.
*20,001 ~ 120,000 health in two attacks.
*120,001+ health in three attacks.

