==Trivia==
*The name Papuu may be derived from ''papal'' (relating to the pope or the papacy) and デブウ ''Debuu'' ([[Daboo of the Dead|Daboo]]'s Japanese name).
*Her Japanese name, ポプウ ''Popuu'', may be derived from ポープ ''pōpu'' (pope) and デブウ ''Debuu''.
*Among the Tier 2 [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], Heavenly Herald Papuu appears to represent the virtue of diligence, as she is constantly studying, even in [[Battle|battle]].
*She can be seen as a foil to Daboo of the Dead. Daboo is an unholy [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] who is told by his "Poppa" that his education is important, but he would rather read trashy horror comics. Papuu, on the other hand, is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] who takes her studies seriously, reading her textbook wherever she goes.
*She is the first enemy to have the Toxic ability.
*She has the longest negative Omni Strike range of all enemies.
*She has the lowest base DPS of all Advent Bosses.

